			x: 4.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["18F323E6ABB96566"]
			description: ["Irradiate a nickel-62 target and it turns into &6nickel-63&r, a pure beta emitter that is safe behind a thin shield and decays for a century."]
