		{
			dependencies: ["7547756221DFC688"]
			description: ["The &6Nuclear Clock Lab&r locks a laser onto a thorium-229 nucleus and keeps time to a part in a quintillion. Its controller, a UHV hull and clean machine casing. The nuclear clock, the timing reference for the Mercury swarm and the gate. Thorium-229 targets come by ME; the clock leaves by ME."]
