		{
			dependencies: ["7547756221DFC688"]
			description: ["The &6Betavoltaic Fab&r builds cells that turn the decay of nickel-63 straight into current, for decades. Its controller, inert machine casing and clean machine casing. Betavoltaic cells for sensors and probes that cannot be recharged. Nickel-63 targets by ME; cells leave by ME."]
