		{
			dependencies: ["7547756221DFC688"]
			description: ["The &6Crystal Growth Furnace&r pulls lithium niobate and other boules out of a melt, slowly. Its controller, robust and heatproof casing, computer casing and tritanium coils. The lithium niobate wafer and the europium-doped boule behind optical memory. Feed seeds and melt by ME; a boule is hours of work, so run several furnaces."]
			icon: "gtceu:crystal_growth_furnace"
