			dependencies: ["7A82260060D3ABC5"]
			description: ["The &6MBE Reactor&r lays a crystal down one atomic layer at a time in ultra-high vacuum. Its controller, a UHV hull and clean machine casing. The indium phosphide wafer and the quantum cascade laser built on it. Substrates and dopants by ME; keep the vacuum pump line free of byproducts."]
