		{
			dependencies: ["7547756221DFC688"]
			description: ["The &6Ultrapure Water Plant&r polishes water until it carries almost no ions at all. Its controller, clean machine casing and filter casing. Water clean enough for the carbide fab and the solar array fab. Pipe it straight to the fabs; do not bucket it."]
